e writing he said i don't write i  am now doctor  and i just felt that there was no way  for me to continue in the patterns i was  in unless i was smoking even if it means  shortening my life for that and  um i certainly don't recommend it to  anybody else i just feel trapped because  i'm not allowed indoors unless i'm  breaking the law uh smoking about the  the other issues september 11th i'll  just read you the last three panels that  follow the uh cowboy boots falling on my  city of my templates which says the  towers have come to loom larger than  life but they seem to get smaller every  day happy anniversary  art spiegel we're out of time thank you  very much  again the book is in the shadows of no  towers art spiegelman available here for  14.95 and in  your bookstores other places for 19.95  we have connie dudley somewhere in the  strand area with people let us know who  you have connie
 

